# Step 1: Origin & Species
ashfall-lifepath-step1-kassik-title = Dusty Lowlands of Kassik
ashfall-lifepath-step1-kassik-desc = Scorched limestone, brutal sun, and dry sand under claw. The first lesson of the arid plains: pity evaporates faster than sweat.

ashfall-lifepath-step1-kirwani-title = Bio-chambers of Clan Kirwani
ashfall-lifepath-step1-kirwani-desc = The steady hum of turbines, cold cathode glow, and the rustle of thousands of wings behind the partition. You were pulled from the pod and numbered before your wings even hardened.

ashfall-lifepath-step1-damascus-title = Lower Levels of "New Damascus"
ashfall-lifepath-step1-damascus-desc = Slums at the very foundation of the spire. Machine grease, permanent damp, and heavy bootsteps overhead. You didn't see real sunlight until adolescence.

# Step 2: Vector
ashfall-lifepath-step2-engi-title = Cold Steel
ashfall-lifepath-step2-engi-desc = Drawn to lathes and wiring since childhood. Metal doesn't lie: if a bolt is torqued right, it holds. People rarely do.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-atmos-title = Ear for the Void
ashfall-lifepath-step2-atmos-desc = Whistle in the bulkheads, pressure ringing in the ears. Others gag at the stench of coolant; you can feel where the loop is leaking with your spine.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-med-title = The Crunch of Bone
ashfall-lifepath-step2-med-desc = You saw your first compound fracture far too young — and didn't look away. Other people's pain brings no panic: only a cold annoyance and the urge to set the bone straight.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-sec-title = Steel Spine
ashfall-lifepath-step2-sec-desc = You learned early: if you don't strike first, they stomp you into the deck grating. Order rests on the person who refuses to avert their gaze.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-serv-title = Dirty Work
ashfall-lifepath-step2-serv-desc = Nobody remembers the ones hauling ash and scrubbing soot off the walls. But without it, the world drowns in its own filth within days.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-cook-title = Dividing Rations
ashfall-lifepath-step2-cook-desc = You remember the taste of hunger all too well. The smell of salt and boiling lard is sacred: as long as the kettle has broth, there is no mutiny.

# Step 3: Inner Crack
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pedant-title = Shut Down
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pedant-desc = When crisis strikes, your mind clings to protocols and paragraphs. Until every clause lines up, you won't budge — even if fire is licking your boots.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pedant-weakness = Freezes up when protocols and procedures are broken.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-daredevil-title = Snap
ashfall-lifepath-step3-daredevil-desc = When chaos erupts, a dull fury hammers your temples. Other people's hesitation infuriates you more than any disaster.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-daredevil-weakness = Aggressive flare-ups and reckless disregard for others' safety.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-paranoid-title = Distrust
ashfall-lifepath-step3-paranoid-desc = Your eyes lock onto the hands and pockets of everyone nearby. Every casual movement looks like preparation for betrayal.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-paranoid-weakness = Distrust of colleagues and delay of rescue measures.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-burnout-title = Burn Out
ashfall-lifepath-step3-burnout-desc = In the thick of disaster, a hollow ice takes over. Your body moves on autopilot, but whether you survive or perish, you simply cannot care.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-burnout-weakness = Severe apathy and loss of initiative under protracted crisis.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-stoic-title = Silence
ashfall-lifepath-step3-stoic-desc = Stone-faced at funerals, stone-faced when the core breaches. No words, no groan. A deaf armor that slowly rots from within.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-stoic-weakness = Never asks for help, even when they must.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-pragmatist-title = Calculate Profit
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pragmatist-desc = Every decision becomes numbers and deadlines. People do not fit into that balance.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pragmatist-weakness = Rushes the math on anything involving people.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-idealist-title = Blinded by Faith
ashfall-lifepath-step3-idealist-desc = I hold on to ideas harder than to people. When reality breaks them, I break with them.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-idealist-weakness = Stubbornness against facts and long disappointment.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-diplomat-title = Maneuver
ashfall-lifepath-step3-diplomat-desc = I put out every conflict with words and pauses. Peace on the deck matters more than justice, at least to me.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-diplomat-weakness = Buries conflicts until they blow up.

# Step 4: Personal Luggage
ashfall-lifepath-step4-dogtag-title = Nameless Dogtag
ashfall-lifepath-step4-dogtag-desc = A brass tag with a hammered-out serial number. Whose it was and why it stayed with me, I will not say even under protocol.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-dogtag-quirk = Constantly fingers the cold metal tag around the neck.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-chip-title = Encrypted Data Chip
ashfall-lifepath-step4-chip-desc = An encrypted memory chip in a titanium shell. I do not remember the passphrase. Maybe I do not want to.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-chip-quirk = Wears thick insulated work gloves concealing subtle finger tremors.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-key-title = Heavy Brass Key
ashfall-lifepath-step4-key-desc = A heavy brass key to someone else's locker on a distant orbital drydock. The drydock itself is long gone.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-key-quirk = Hides glances beneath an old cap or patched visor.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-cigs-title = Crushed Pack of Cigarettes
ashfall-lifepath-step4-cigs-desc = A crumpled pack of cheap orbital tobacco and a lighter engraved with the name of a long-shuttered berth. Last pack, honest word.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-cigs-quirk = Lights a smoke at the first lull between station alerts.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-flask-title = Flask with a Stranger's Monogram
ashfall-lifepath-step4-flask-desc = A steel flask with a stranger's name scratched into the bottom. What sloshes inside is noticeably stronger than water.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-flask-quirk = Pours for guests first; drinks alone.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-namelist-title = List in the Sleeve Lining
ashfall-lifepath-step4-namelist-desc = A column of names faded by washing. Who they are, you will not say even under protocol.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-namelist-quirk = Runs a finger down the list now and then, as if checking it.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-letter-title = Unsent Letter
ashfall-lifepath-step4-letter-desc = A sheet folded in four, sealed with a drop of wax. Where to send it, you do not know yourself.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-letter-quirk = Keeps the letter in an inside pocket, close to the heart.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-card-title = Dead Station Access Card
ashfall-lifepath-step4-card-desc = An access card to a facility listed in no registry. The reader still recognizes it.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-card-quirk = Never parts with the pass under any circumstances.

